---
import { Database, GitBranch, MessagesSquare, ServerCog } from "@lucide/astro";
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section class="section shell" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <SectionHeader number="01" title="About" />
  <div class="about-grid">
    <h2 id="about-title">
      From the business question to the <em>running platform.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        My strength is versatility across the delivery chain. I can understand the client’s need,
        turn it into the right data model, implement the transformations, and provision the compute
        and storage needed to run it reliably.
      </p>
      <p>
        This end-to-end view lets me make technical decisions with both the business outcome and the
        operating reality in mind.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ol class="delivery-chain" aria-label="End-to-end delivery capabilities">
    <li>
      <div class="delivery-chain__topline">
        <span>01</span>
        <MessagesSquare aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
      <strong>Understand</strong>
      <p>Clarify the client need and the decision the data must support.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="delivery-chain__topline">
        <span>02</span>
        <Database aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
      <strong>Model</strong>
      <p>Design data models and contracts that reflect the business.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="delivery-chain__topline">
        <span>03</span>
        <GitBranch aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
      <strong>Transform</strong>
      <p>Implement tested, maintainable pipelines and transformations.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="delivery-chain__topline">
        <span>04</span>
        <ServerCog aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
      <strong>Operate</strong>
      <p>Provision compute, storage, deployment, and observability.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
